[I] A Bison grammar to convert TeX math into MathML

[T] mtex2MML is a Bison grammar to convert TeX math into MathML, usable as a
[T] standalone program or a static library written in C99. It is a fork of
[T] itex2MML with much more extensive AMS-TeX math support.

[U] https://github.com/gjtorikian/mtex2MML

[A] Mtex2mml Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

